    "body": "Sure, I know it can be fixed manually, I just wasn't sure if that was the best design for the platform, as it puts the burden on every component author.\n\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11148#issuecomment-2743925248 - @smaug---- seems to think this shouldn't be on every component author to fix.\n\nIt seems worth exploring options that do the right thing by default.",
